  @Description_35146e40 = N'Strongly-typed JSON of what this harness can do (the IHarnessCapabilitySettings interface, bound via JSONType metadata): session continuity (SessionResume), turn-protocol support (StructuredOutput), in-sandbox permission interception (PermissionHooks), and whether the harness can act as an MCP client for the read-only loopback (McpClient). The runtime gates behaviour on these - when SessionResume is false the adapter must replay prior context into a fresh invocation each turn, which costs extra tokens and has to be budgeted for. Held as JSON so a new capability needs no schema migration, just an added property on the interface. NULL/omitted = not supported.'
